%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 09_Chapter9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_09
  storyName: A King's Daily Duties
  storyDescription: 'Noz explains Daily Objectives. Reward: Gems for your first claim.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 9
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e37f85c34b98be2d5b320c70fd1d9919, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Noz approaches the group carrying a small collection of documents. They
        contain several tasks and records.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What are those?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your daily assignments.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: My what?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Daily Objectives. There are several tasks you can complete to receive
        additional resources.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: More work?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: MORE REWARDS!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's not what I asked.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Completing these objectives will help you develop your party and gather
        supplies.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are they mandatory?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: No. But they are useful if you want to make steady progress.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Think of them as small investments that reward consistency.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND YOU GET FREE STUFF!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You two really have a way of describing everything.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: There are different objectives available. Some can be completed by participating
        in Concept Clashes, while others may involve using your characters or visiting
        certain facilities.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So I just complete the tasks and receive the rewards?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. However, completing an objective does not automatically transfer
        its reward to you. You must claim it yourself.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is simply how the system works.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Of course it is.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please open the Daily Objectives menu.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  background: {fileID: 2365596823942982563, guid: 2131dec12abd08c9aabdc9c28f88f2f1,
    type: 3}
  storyRewards: []
  rewardEntries:
  - reward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d81f2fa6903ec7078955ac2c89b06b1, type: 2}
    amount: 300
  nextStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2303977e22bd8bb7b781ef76466a4df, type: 2}
  afterScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c6c12e2b07f2f40cab35afbc1d93b560, type: 2}
  afterSceneToasts:
  - time: 1.5
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Here you can see the objectives available for today.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Each objective has its own requirements and rewards.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Objectives you've completed will become available to claim.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.8
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Select the completed objective to claim its reward.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Good. Now press the Claim button.
    duration: 4.5
  afterGachaPullToasts: []
  afterAction: 3
  afterActionToasts:
  - time: 1.2
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Well done, Your Majesty. The reward has been added to your inventory.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Return to the main menu when you're ready.
    duration: 4.5
  followUpLines:
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: So I need to remember to claim them myself?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Exactly. Completing the task is only half the process.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: DON'T FORGET YOUR REWARDS!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I think I can remember that.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: There may also be additional rewards for completing several objectives
      within the same day.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: So the more objectives I complete, the more rewards I can receive?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Correct. Be sure to check your progress.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: And these objectives reset every day?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Yes. New objectives will become available after the daily reset.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Consistency is a valuable investment.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: AND DON'T FORGET TO COME BACK TOMORROW!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I was hoping for a day off.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: You are the King of All Concepts, Your Majesty.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: That doesn't mean I can't take a break.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: BUT YOU CAN GET MORE REWARDS!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: ...I knew you were going to say that.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: So, that's everything?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: For now, yes.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Fighting, switching, using my authority, shopping, gacha, and daily assignments.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: You've learned quite a lot.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: AND YOU HAVE US!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: AND YOU CAN ALWAYS COME BACK FOR MORE PULLS!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Please don't encourage her.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3e64c97bdf51dc37bfd93cf40728166, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: DID SOMEONE SAY FIGHTING?!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: ...Where did he come from?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I believe we should get going.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Wait. I still need to find a way home.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 1
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: A brief silence.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Of course. But first, there are things you need to understand about this
      world.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Like what?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Everything.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 1
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: 'The camera slowly pulls away from the group. Around them, Concept Spirits
      carry on: some argue, some trade, and some fight.'
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 1
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: The Concept World is vast.
    blackScreen: 1
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 1
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: And this is only the beginning.
    blackScreen: 1
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  timeLimitSeconds: 600
  storyMusic: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8bb118ed9afc98ecb6078abc6c0d285, type: 2}
